Deep presieve on GPU, you can start sieve with minimum pmax or setum maximum (VRAM limit)
below i start n 5435752 and range k-100000-200000 with minimum p, saved to file than i add flag --pstart with p i finished before and higher pmax and test only sirvived 
candidates loaded from file. I made with that method several batches with survived candidates, below how it works
flag --k-end is only necessery on beginig, when you have candidates in file, later i set --k-start can be low, all k are saved and loaded from file. Important is "N" number


 ./prothlogic --n 5435752 --k-start 100000 --pstart 110000000000000 --pmax 500000000000000 --in-file ocalali_batch5.txt --out-sieve ocalali_batch6.txt --sieve-only

